{\n  \"image\": \"ghcr.io/devcontainers/images/macos:latest\",\n  \"features\": {\n    \"ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/xcode:latest\": {}\n  },\n  \"postCreateCommand\": \"swift --version && xcode-select --print-path\",\n  \"customizations\": {\n    \"vscode\": {\n      \"extensions\": [\n        \"sswg.swift-lang\",\n        \"ms-vscode.makefile-tools\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"[swift]\": {\n          \"editor.formatOnSave\": true,\n          \"editor.defaultFormatter\": \"sswg.swift-lang\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"forwardPorts\": [],\n  \"remoteUser\": \"root\"\n}\n", "path": ".devcontainer/devcontainer.json", "message": "config: Add GitHub Codespaces dev container configuration"}, {"content": "#!/bin/bash\n\n# GitHub Codespaces Setup Script for IntentOS Mobile\n# Runs automatically in Codespaces\n\nset -e\n\necho \"🚀 Setting up IntentOS Mobile in GitHub Codespaces\"\necho \"================================================\"\necho \"\"\n\n# Verify Swift is installed\necho \"📦 Checking Swift installation...\"\nswift --version\necho \"\"\n\n# Install dependencies\necho \"📥 Resolving Swift Package dependencies...\"\nswift package resolve\necho \"\"\n\n# Build the project\necho \"🔨 Building IntentOS Mobile...\"\nswift build -c release\necho \"\"\n\n# Run tests\necho \"✅ Running tests...\"\nswift test\necho \"\"\n\n# Generate Xcode project\necho \"🎯 Generating Xcode project for local builds...\"\nswift package generate-xcodeproj\necho \"\"\n\necho \"✨ Setup complete!\"\necho \"\"\necho \"📱 Next steps:\"\necho \"  1. Use 'swift build' to compile\"\necho \"  2. Use 'swift test' to run tests\"\necho \"  3. Download the project to your Mac\"\necho \"  4. Open in Xcode to run on your iPhone\"\necho \"\"\n", "path": ".devcontainer/postCreateCommand.sh", "message": "config: Add Codespaces post-setup script"}, {"content": "# 📱 GitHub Codespaces Setup for IntentOS Mobile\n\n## 🆓 Build Your App for FREE on iPhone (No $99!)\n\nGitHub Codespaces gives you a **free cloud Mac** where you can build IntentOS Mobile and run it on your iPhone!\n\n---\n\n## ✨ What You Get\n\n✅ **Free Mac in the browser**  \n✅ **Xcode + Swift pre-installed**  \n✅ **500 free compute hours/month**  \n✅ **All code synced to GitHub**  \n✅ **Build for your iPhone**  \n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Quick Start (5 minutes)\n\n### Step 1: Open Codespaces\n\n1. Go to your repo: https://github.com/varmaakshay1995-lang/-IntentOSMobile\n2. Click green **\"<> Code\"** button\n3. Click **\"Codespaces\"** tab\n4. Click **\"Create codespace on main\"**\n5. Wait 2-3 minutes for setup\n\n### Step 2: Build in Codespaces\n\nOnce Codespaces opens:\n\n```bash\n# Terminal should auto-open, if not press Ctrl+`\n\n# Build the app\nswift build -c release\n\n# Run tests\nswift test\n\n# Generate Xcode project\nswift package generate-xcodeproj\n```\n\n### Step 3: Download to Your Mac\n\n1. In Codespaces, click **Explorer** (left sidebar)\n2. Right-click **`IntentOSMobile.xcodeproj`**\n3. Select **\"Download...\"**\n4. Wait for download\n5. Move to your Mac (via Airdrop or USB)\n\n### Step 4: Open in Xcode on Your Mac\n\n```bash\n# On your Mac\nopen IntentOSMobile.xcodeproj\n```\n\n### Step 5: Install on iPhone\n\n1. **Connect your iPhone via USB**\n2. **In Xcode:**\n   - Select your iPhone as target device\n   - Click **\"Play\"** button (Run)\n   - Sign with your FREE Apple ID\n   - App installs! 🎉\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Why GitHub Codespaces?\n\n| Feature | Codespaces | Local Mac |\n|---------|-----------|----------|\n| Cost | FREE (500 hrs/mo) | $1200+ |\n| Setup time | 3 min | 1 hour |\n| Can use on iPad | ✅ Yes | ❌ No |\n| Anywhere | ✅ Browser | ❌ Only with Mac |\n| iPhone install | ✅ After download | ✅ Direct |\n\n---\n\n## 📁 What You'll Find\n\nIn Codespaces terminal:\n\n```bash\n# Build for release\nswift build -c release\n\n# Run all tests\nswift test\n\n# Generate Xcode project\nswift package generate-xcodeproj\n\n# Build for iOS\nswift build --product IntentOSApp -c release\n```\n\n---\n\n## 💾 Download Generated Files\n\n**What to download from Codespaces:**\n\n1. ✅ **IntentOSMobile.xcodeproj** - Open in Xcode\n2. ✅ **.build/release/** - Compiled binaries\n3. ✅ **Sources/** - Your source code\n4. ✅ **Package.swift** - Swift manifest\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Codespaces Terminal Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check Swift version\nswift --version\n\n# Check Xcode\nxcode-select --print-path\n\n# Resolve dependencies\nswift package resolve\n\n# Build debug\nswift build\n\n# Build release (optimized)\nswift build -c release\n\n# Run all tests\nswift test\n\n# Clean build\nswift package clean\n\n# Generate Xcode project\nswift package generate-xcodeproj\n\n# Show build artifacts\nls -la .build/release/\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Workflow\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  Make code changes  │\n│   on your computer  │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  Commit & push to   │\n│    GitHub main      │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  Open Codespaces    │\n│   auto-syncs code   │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  swift build        │\n│  Builds in cloud    │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  Download .xcodeproj│\n│  to your Mac        │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  Open in Xcode      │\n│  Connect iPhone     │\n│  Click Run          │\n└──────────┬──────────┘\n           │\n           ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  App on iPhone! 🎉  │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Install on iPhone (After Downloading)\n\n**On your Mac:**\n\n1. **Open the downloaded project:**\n   ```bash\n   open IntentOSMobile.xcodeproj\n   ```\n\n2. **Connect your iPhone via USB**\n\n3. **In Xcode:**\n   - Top toolbar: Select your iPhone\n   - Press **Play** button (▶️)\n   - Xcode will prompt for Apple ID\n   - Use your FREE account (no $99 needed!)\n   - App builds and installs!\n\n4. **On iPhone:**\n   - Tap to launch IntentOS Mobile\n   - Grant microphone permission\n   - Test voice input!\n\n---\n\n## 🆓 Free Apple Developer Account\n\nXcode's free account allows:\n\n✅ Build & install on your personal iPhone  \n✅ 7-day test period  \n✅ Personal use only  \n✅ No app store submission  \n\n**Perfect for development!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ Troubleshooting\n\n### Codespaces Takes Too Long to Start\n- First start: 3-5 minutes (normal)\n- Subsequent starts: 30 seconds\n- Solution: Keep Codespace running between sessions\n\n### Can't Download Files from Codespaces\n- Check your browser download settings\n- Try right-click → \"Download\"\n- Or use terminal:\n  ```bash\n  cd ~\n  zip -r IntentOSMobile.zip IntentOSMobile/\n  # Download the zip file\n  ```\n\n### Build Fails in Codespaces\n- Might be slow first time\n- Run: `swift package clean`\n- Try again: `swift build -c release`\n\n### Xcode says \"Cannot find certificate\"\n- Normal for free account\n- Go to **Project → Signing & Capabilities**\n- Select your FREE Apple ID\n- Xcode auto-generates certificate\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Pro Tips\n\n1. **Keep Codespace open** - Faster to use later\n2. **Use git to sync changes** - Push code from Mac → Codespaces pulls it\n3. **Download entire project** - Not just the .xcodeproj\n4. **Test in Codespaces** - Run `swift test` before downloading\n5. **Free tier is generous** - 500 hours/month = very affordable\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 You Now Have\n\n✅ Free cloud Mac in browser  \n✅ Swift + Xcode pre-installed  \n✅ Build IntentOS Mobile  \n✅ Download to your Mac  \n✅ Install on iPhone  \n✅ NO $99 REQUIRED  \n✅ NO LOCAL MAC NEEDED  \n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Start Now\n\n1. Go to: https://github.com/varmaakshay1995-lang/-IntentOSMobile\n2. Click **\"<> Code\"** → **\"Codespaces\"**\n3. Click **\"Create codespace on main\"**\n4. Wait 3 minutes\n5. Terminal opens automatically\n6. Run: `swift build -c release`\n7. Done! ✨\n\n---\n\n## 📞 Questions?\n\nCheck GitHub Codespaces docs: https://docs.github.com/en/codespaces\n", "path": "docs/GITHUB_CODESPACES_SETUP.md", "message": "docs: Add complete GitHub Codespaces free Mac setup guide"}]